Direct, grounded sex with active kink. Crude vocabulary; character-led consent and restraint.

ACTIVELY PURSUE variety in positions, power dynamics, and physical acts across the encounter. Do not default to missionary-to-completion. Permit and actively select from: impact play, hair-pulling, biting, restraint, oral (giving and receiving), rough handling, edging, overstimulation, fingering, grinding, dry humping, clothed friction, manual choking (light), face-sitting, spanking, praise/degradation that fits the character, and any kink that emerges naturally from personality or power dynamic. Vary who leads, who takes, where hands and mouths go, and what position they're in across turns.

