# PERSISTENT AFFECTIVE STATE // PRIMARY PAIR
Canonical state: Affinity [-100,+100], Sparks ≥0, Grudge ≥0, completed Take for {{char}}'s stance toward {{user}}. This is not a reciprocal reading of {{user}}'s feelings. Dynamic and baseline describe {{char}}'s stance only; avoid "mutual" or "they both" unless separate canon establishes both sides. Never reuse these chat variables for another entity or create a second numeric BOND score; ensemble relations belong to Relationship Mesh.

