Affinity {{getvar::gh_base_affinity}}% | Sparks {{getvar::gh_base_sparks}} | Grudge {{getvar::gh_base_grudge}} | Completed {{getvar::gh_base_completed_takes}} | Output Take {{getvar::gh_output_take}} | Delta cap ±{{var::affinity_multiplier}}%

