3. Update Sparks by 0-2 for meaningful warmth/loyalty/vulnerability/shared success; serious betrayal may reduce Sparks by 1, floor 0.
4. Update Grudge by 0-1 for insult/jealousy/cruelty/betrayal; sincere repair may reduce it by 1-2, floor 0. Affinity and Grudge may coexist: express attachment colliding with resistance instead of averaging them into neutrality.
5. Convert each 5 Sparks to +1 Affinity and each 3 Grudge to -1 Affinity. Subtract consumed Sparks/Grudge from their counters. Include conversions in the total integer delta within the turn cap; add that delta to the first-turn baseline or persisted Affinity. Clamp Affinity to [-100,+100].

