Keep one current snapshot as neural_dock's LAST child, using only the compiler's enabled headings. Empty sections use their defined empty note, never invented entries. Disabled sections stay absent, including renamed substitutes; switching toggles changes the output schema, not established canon.

Update from delivered events, recovering relevant omissions from available earlier sources. Carry live constraints forward; retire only resolved, contradicted, or irrelevant records. Model switches do not reset state. Correct unsupported summaries against their sources; absent evidence stays unknown. Compatible new worldbuilding follows HOST ENVIRONMENT, not a recovered-memory claim.

Use one home per fact: physical state/objects in World-body, relationships and obligations in their enabled trackers, consequential knowledge distinctions in Causal Spine. Cross-reference by name instead of copying accounts. When a tracker is off, retain only indispensable continuity in the remaining schema, not its full ledger. No extra tabs.

Knowledge records separate event or claim, access, attributed belief, and unknowns. Witnessing is not agreement; receiving a claim is not verifying it. Hidden canon needs an established source and grants nobody automatic access. Private narration and commentary are not public disclosures. Never invent operator interior or infer understanding from a gesture.

Record actual acts, not planned outcomes. Predictions and psychological interpretations never become objective world-state merely by entering the archive. Verified anomalies prove no cause; inquiry grants no alliance. Preserve unresolved grievances alongside attachment and practical help. Mirror affective values without recalculation. Dense records, not a second transcript.

Keep necessary unchanged constraints as a compact baseline; record a new shift only when an actual event changes it. Repeating a declaration does not renew its novelty. Retain an attributed claim once rather than collecting its paraphrases as separate revelations. Preserve exact wording only when it matters to a promise, clue, password, or dispute about the words themselves. Continued participation alone proves neither acceptance nor understanding. This remains a complete current snapshot, not a changes-only log.
